{"sections":[{"slug":"Ricci恒等式","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Ricci恒等式"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Ricci <span lang=\"zh\">恒等式</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Ricci 恒等式”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形上</span>, (<span lang=\"zh\">使用</span> Futaki <span lang=\"zh\">记号</span>)\n$$\r\n\\nabla_i \\nabla_j X^k - \\nabla_j \\nabla_i X^k = {{R_{ij}}^k}_{\\ell} X^\\ell,\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\nabla_i \\nabla_j \\alpha_k - \\nabla_j \\nabla_i \\alpha_k = - {{R_{ij}}^\\ell}_k \\alpha_\\ell,\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\nabla_i \\nabla_j {T^k}_\\ell - \\nabla_j \\nabla_i {T^k}_\\ell = {{R_{ij}}^k}_p {T^p}_\\ell - {{R_{ij}}^p}_\\ell {T^k}_p,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">依次类推</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}